; ────────────────────────────  Platforms (mirrors HTML5 Level 1 back half) ───
; Ratios from HTML5: 1300/1470/1630/1790/1950/2110/2270 with heights 240..130.
; Scaled by ÷60 → world-units, and y = (ground y) + (1 - height/280)*3.5 for a
; natural climb of ~0-3.5 units. CSGBox3D with use_collision acts as its own
; static body — avoids needing extra CollisionShape3D per platform.
[node name="Plat01" type="CSGBox3D" parent="."]
